English note: This license covers the source code in this repository only. It does
not cover third-party binaries (which are not redistributed here) nor any book
content downloaded by the tool. The tool only parses publicly accessible pages,
does not break DRM, and does not bypass logins or paywalls. Downloaded text is for
personal offline reading only; do not redistribute. Use at your own risk.
